+++    """Parse resource indicator URL into (surface, workspace_slug, project_key).
+++
+++    Supports:
+++        - /mcp
+++        - /mcp/w/{workspace_slug}
+++        - /mcp/w/{workspace_slug}/p/{project_key}
+++        - /mcp/{surface}
+++        - /mcp/{surface}/w/{workspace_slug}
+++        - /mcp/{surface}/w/{workspace_slug}/p/{project_key}
