++   - `kanban/web/src/app/Sidebar.tsx`, `BoardColumn.tsx`, `ListView.tsx`, `WorkflowStudioPage.tsx`: Project `🔀 Workflows` nav item and contextual `+ Workflow` section action pre-populating `AttachHookDialog`.
