++### 2.4 Static SPA Routing Boundary Hardening
++- **Boundary Protection in `PrecompressedSPAStaticApp._resolve_spa_fallback`:** Expanded `disallowed_prefixes` to:
++  `("/api", "/ws", "/sse", "/mcp", "/.well-known", "/oauth", "/internal")`
